  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Auburn, between classes",
    "overview": "Navy structure, warm orange emphasis, and white work areas frame a compact student dining utility. Locally served Barlow gives headings, metrics, and controls a consistent, approachable voice. This Auburn-inspired treatment belongs to an independent student prototype; it does not establish official university affiliation.",
